      "id": "oml-intro-ob-realities-and-challenges-c3",
      "heading": "Today's challenges for the Indian workplace",
      "explanation_md": "For the **Indian workplace**, the slide names three challenges:\n\n1. **Productivity**\n2. **Effectiveness**\n3. **Efficiency**\n\nThe diagram recalls the earlier difference: **effective** means doing **the right things** (input to the right output), **efficient** means doing **the things right** (a small input giving a large output).\n\nThe module ends with a **case study**, *\"Lessons for 'Undercover' Bosses\"*. Only its title is on the slide.",
